1
00:00:08,348 --> 00:00:11,156
(With Vengeance, Sincerely,
Your Broken Saintess Season 2)

2
00:01:30,953 --> 00:01:32,101
(Episode 3: The Final Day of the Birth Festival)
Excuse me,

3
00:01:32,102 --> 00:01:35,798
(Episode 3: The Final Day of the Birth Festival)
did you stop that pickpocket earlier?

4
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:38,203
I see you're as sharp as ever.

5
00:01:38,754 --> 00:01:41,996
Oh, Charlotte, is that you?

6
00:01:41,997 --> 00:01:44,306
It's been a long time, Miss Lua.

7
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,452
I'm so glad to see you are doing well.

8
00:01:46,453 --> 00:01:48,800
Is this gentleman Alan from the bakery?

9
00:01:48,801 --> 00:01:49,649
Yes.

10
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:52,507
Thank you
for taking care of my wife before.

11
00:01:52,902 --> 00:01:53,805
Your wife...

12
00:01:54,503 --> 00:01:59,252
After you resolved
the Dedmond matter for us,

13
00:01:59,649 --> 00:02:02,350
Alan proposed to me again.

14
00:02:02,351 --> 00:02:04,453
We just got married not long ago.

15
00:02:05,899 --> 00:02:07,053
Congratulations.

16
00:02:07,054 --> 00:02:08,602
As for the compensation money we received,

17
00:02:08,603 --> 00:02:11,051
I shared it with the other girls
who were Dedmond's victims.

18
00:02:11,052 --> 00:02:13,893
Many of them are starting
to get back on their feet.

19
00:02:13,894 --> 00:02:15,904
Not only the physical wounds,

20
00:02:15,905 --> 00:02:20,206
you also healed our emotional scars,
Miss Lua.

21
00:02:20,207 --> 00:02:22,105
You are the true Saintess.

22
00:02:23,554 --> 00:02:25,962
No, you're far too kind.

23
00:02:26,351 --> 00:02:27,556
But it's truly incredible.

24
00:02:27,557 --> 00:02:30,684
I only used my torturing ability
back then,

25
00:02:31,253 --> 00:02:34,284
yet she said I healed their wounds.

26
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,503
Oh, right. Please take these.

27
00:02:38,451 --> 00:02:40,198
Thank you so much.

28
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:41,953
At the final day's piano performances,

29
00:02:41,954 --> 00:02:45,960
I'll throw out
this white rose you gave me.

30
00:02:46,402 --> 00:02:47,802
What do you mean?

31
00:02:48,852 --> 00:02:51,850
It's a tradition that developed
among the people.

32
00:02:51,851 --> 00:02:53,757
You might not be aware of it.

33
00:02:54,349 --> 00:02:55,650
When the performances are over,

34
00:02:55,651 --> 00:02:57,301
everyone holds two roses
that represent the two princesses,

35
00:02:57,302 --> 00:03:01,109
and throws the one they think is better.

36
00:03:02,953 --> 00:03:05,896
Some people base their choice
on the performances,

37
00:03:05,897 --> 00:03:09,058
while others pick the Candidate Saintess
who helped them before.

38
00:03:09,059 --> 00:03:11,117
Basically, it's entirely up to us.

39
00:03:11,903 --> 00:03:13,848
Receiving more support

40
00:03:13,849 --> 00:03:16,053
doesn't amount to any tangible benefits.

41
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:19,802
But it does prove one's popularity
among the people.

42
00:03:19,803 --> 00:03:23,436
It might help with our plans later on.

43
00:03:24,104 --> 00:03:27,001
Miss Lua, we will definitely give you
our full support.

44
00:03:27,002 --> 00:03:29,153
Alan, you have to throw
the white rose too.

45
00:03:29,154 --> 00:03:31,609
I know.

46
00:03:32,001 --> 00:03:33,102
Anyway,

47
00:03:33,103 --> 00:03:35,899
it's truly wonderful
to see them so happy now.

48
00:03:39,451 --> 00:03:42,413
Yesterday went smoothly, and the Birth Festival
has reached its second day.

49
00:03:43,601 --> 00:03:45,059
It's the other Rose Princess.

50
00:03:45,060 --> 00:03:46,349
Rose Princess!

51
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:47,819
Over here!

52
00:03:49,404 --> 00:03:53,598
I heard there'd be a bit of free time
between events today,

53
00:03:53,599 --> 00:03:57,347
but wearing the Rose Princess dress
and having guards around

54
00:03:57,348 --> 00:04:00,003
mean I can't exactly roam around freely.

55
00:04:00,654 --> 00:04:03,242
Still, I can at least
browse the street stalls.

56
00:04:05,253 --> 00:04:06,356
This is...

57
00:04:07,153 --> 00:04:08,257
It's beautiful.

58
00:04:08,756 --> 00:04:10,683
It looks just like Sven's eyes.

59
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,758
Welcome, Rose Princess.

60
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:16,949
Does this item catch your fancy?

61
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:21,604
This perfume is made from a rare plant
that only grows in the southern island kingdom.

62
00:04:21,605 --> 00:04:22,854
I heard that in that kingdom,

63
00:04:22,855 --> 00:04:25,099
this scent is only used
by men of noble status.

64
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:26,906
So it'll make a perfect gift.

65
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,106
It's true.

66
00:04:30,107 --> 00:04:31,362
The scent is wonderful.

67
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:33,256
A gift...

68
00:04:33,257 --> 00:04:35,655
Would Sven use something like this?

69
00:04:37,703 --> 00:04:40,595
Are you perhaps thinking of
buying it as a gift for Prince Sven?

70
00:04:40,596 --> 00:04:41,700
N-No.

71
00:04:41,701 --> 00:04:43,755
This isn't something for royalty...

72
00:04:43,756 --> 00:04:46,855
Though the prince doesn't usually
use perfume,

73
00:04:46,856 --> 00:04:51,100
he seems to have been very interested
in the southern island kingdom's culture.

74
00:04:51,101 --> 00:04:53,055
He even hopes to establish diplomatic relations
with them in the future.

75
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:54,703
Really?

76
00:04:54,704 --> 00:04:56,407
Then maybe this could be...

77
00:04:56,852 --> 00:04:59,505
I'm sure the prince will be overjoyed

78
00:04:59,506 --> 00:05:01,698
to receive any gift from you, Miss Lua.

79
00:05:01,699 --> 00:05:03,802
- Will he really?
- He will.

80
00:05:05,357 --> 00:05:07,155
Then I'll buy this.

81
00:05:07,557 --> 00:05:10,600
It shouldn't be weird to thank him
for looking out for me, right?

82
00:05:10,601 --> 00:05:12,100
When should I give it to him?

83
00:05:12,951 --> 00:05:15,299
Hey, what's the commotion about?

84
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:18,997
They're holding a drinking contest
in front of the tavern.

85
00:05:18,998 --> 00:05:21,197
It's an annual tradition
of the Birth Festival.

86
00:05:21,198 --> 00:05:22,999
I thought Marta from the butcher shop
would win again this year,

87
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,749
so I bet on him.

88
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:28,603
Then this hooded lady joined,
and her tolerance is terrifyingly high.

89
00:05:28,604 --> 00:05:30,810
Wait, is that Lady Diana?

90
00:05:31,356 --> 00:05:34,210
And isn't that Louis behind her
as her attendant?

91
00:05:34,605 --> 00:05:36,249
Hey, Louis!

92
00:05:36,250 --> 00:05:38,005
What on earth are you doing here?

93
00:05:38,656 --> 00:05:39,851
Miss Lua.

94
00:05:39,852 --> 00:05:41,647
I never expected to run into you here.

95
00:05:41,648 --> 00:05:43,648
The Rose Princess attire
suits you perfectly.

96
00:05:43,649 --> 00:05:46,096
Never mind that,
just explain what's going on.

97
00:05:46,097 --> 00:05:53,505
Prince Sarid planned to sneak out
to the festival with Lady Diana,

98
00:05:53,506 --> 00:05:57,153
but he got completely swamped
with duties hosting important guests.

99
00:05:57,154 --> 00:05:59,949
Lady Diana offered to help him out,

100
00:05:59,950 --> 00:06:02,749
but the Prince told her
to go enjoy the festival on her own.

101
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:04,404
As a result, she started sulking

102
00:06:04,405 --> 00:06:06,696
and ended up doing something
unbecoming of a noble lady.

103
00:06:06,697 --> 00:06:08,648
Prince Sarid...

104
00:06:08,649 --> 00:06:09,602
Well, he had to receive guests

105
00:06:09,603 --> 00:06:12,250
because Sven pushed his own duty
onto Prince Sarid.

106
00:06:12,653 --> 00:06:15,850
But even so, you shouldn't be
the only attendant.

107
00:06:15,851 --> 00:06:16,846
Of course not.

108
00:06:16,847 --> 00:06:21,906
As you know, Miss Lua,
I'm so weak I can't even defeat Lewitt.

109
00:06:22,953 --> 00:06:24,062
Lewitt...

110
00:06:24,953 --> 00:06:28,806
It's been a while
since I've heard my late brother's name.

111
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:34,701
After this Birth Festival is over,

112
00:06:34,702 --> 00:06:38,558
regarding the questions
about your family's deaths,

113
00:06:38,559 --> 00:06:41,760
I want us to sit down
and have a thorough talk.

114
00:06:42,654 --> 00:06:45,805
Even though I know what I have to say
might only add to your confusion.

115
00:06:46,204 --> 00:06:48,458
Don't worry about me.

116
00:06:48,459 --> 00:06:52,205
I was planning to talk to you about it
once the Birth Festival ended.

117
00:06:52,206 --> 00:06:53,950
By then, please tell me
everything you know.

118
00:06:54,705 --> 00:06:57,743
Miss Lua, you've grown strong.

119
00:06:58,303 --> 00:07:01,997
Even if the truth will bring me pain,

120
00:07:01,998 --> 00:07:05,104
I will accept it and keep moving forward.

121
00:07:05,703 --> 00:07:06,303
THE FINAL DAY OF THE BIRTH FESTIVAL
It's the final day.

122
00:07:06,304 --> 00:07:08,301
THE FINAL DAY OF THE BIRTH FESTIVAL
This year's festival is coming to an end.

123
00:07:08,302 --> 00:07:09,956
You brought your roses, right?

124
00:07:09,957 --> 00:07:10,999
Of course I did.

125
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,441
- It's the main event of the festival.
- Everyone, be quiet.

126
00:07:13,859 --> 00:07:18,406
In recent years, the damage caused by magical beasts
has inflicted severe suffering upon our people.

127
00:07:18,407 --> 00:07:21,453
Through the tireless,
sacrificial efforts of our Temple,

128
00:07:21,454 --> 00:07:23,605
we have managed
to keep the number of casualties down.

129
00:07:23,606 --> 00:07:27,155
But I am sure the disaster
has left its mark on all of you.

130
00:07:27,156 --> 00:07:31,101
Yet, because of the Temple
and our Candidate Saintesses,

131
00:07:31,102 --> 00:07:35,252
we can safely celebrate
the final day of this year's Birth Festival.

132
00:07:35,253 --> 00:07:37,748
Please offer thanks to the Temple,

133
00:07:37,749 --> 00:07:40,355
and pledge your loyalty
to the Goddess Ruche.

134
00:07:40,356 --> 00:07:42,198
Well said, High Priest!

135
00:07:42,199 --> 00:07:44,058
- What a compassionate priest.
- Same old tricks from him.

136
00:07:44,059 --> 00:07:45,457
- He does everything within his power
- Putting on a show

137
00:07:45,458 --> 00:07:47,767
- to help us common folk.
- when he's the mastermind behind the beast attacks.

138
00:07:48,650 --> 00:07:51,860
I will expose you for who you really are.

139
00:07:57,055 --> 00:07:58,058
Arianne.

140
00:07:58,856 --> 00:08:00,259
Isn't it Lua?

141
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:02,585
What's with that look on your face?
Are you okay?

142
00:08:03,901 --> 00:08:06,454
Are you nervous
because you're up next to perform?

143
00:08:06,455 --> 00:08:08,605
Well, you're playing right after me.

144
00:08:08,606 --> 00:08:10,499
People are bound to compare us.

145
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,796
Unlike you,

146
00:08:11,797 --> 00:08:14,550
I actually have a home to return to.

147
00:08:14,551 --> 00:08:17,102
I've had a proper
noble upbringing, after all.

148
00:08:17,506 --> 00:08:19,053
But it's fine.

149
00:08:19,054 --> 00:08:21,140
As long as you get through
your performance,

150
00:08:21,601 --> 00:08:24,854
I'm sure people will toss
a few roses your way.

151
00:08:24,855 --> 00:08:25,957
What's going on?

152
00:08:25,958 --> 00:08:27,501
Her tone is a bit odd.

153
00:08:27,802 --> 00:08:30,502
So don't get discouraged,
just try your best to finish, okay?

154
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:32,505
Arianne.

155
00:08:32,506 --> 00:08:34,153
Can I ask you something?

156
00:08:34,154 --> 00:08:35,354
What is it?

157
00:08:35,355 --> 00:08:37,753
When I first came to the Temple,

158
00:08:37,754 --> 00:08:40,499
you reached out to me first.

159
00:08:40,901 --> 00:08:44,220
Hey, are you Lua?

160
00:08:44,902 --> 00:08:47,006
Y-yes.

161
00:08:47,801 --> 00:08:49,303
Perfect.

162
00:08:49,304 --> 00:08:53,200
I'm Arianne Trebias
of the Count Trebias family.

163
00:08:53,201 --> 00:08:56,203
I'd like to be your friend.

164
00:08:58,603 --> 00:09:02,060
Were you already planning
to take advantage of me back then?

165
00:09:02,061 --> 00:09:03,451
Didn't I tell you?

166
00:09:03,452 --> 00:09:05,201
"Perfect."

167
00:09:05,202 --> 00:09:08,703
It meant I thought you'd be a great tool.

168
00:09:08,704 --> 00:09:10,300
I've said it before, haven't I?

169
00:09:10,301 --> 00:09:13,705
You're nothing more than a nice toy
for me to kill time with.

170
00:09:13,706 --> 00:09:18,048
Who would ever want to be real friends
with a Broken Saintess who's an orphan?

171
00:09:18,049 --> 00:09:19,295
It's hilarious.

172
00:09:19,296 --> 00:09:22,154
You're still so stupid, Lua.

173
00:09:22,155 --> 00:09:23,600
I finally see it now.

174
00:09:23,601 --> 00:09:25,922
You've been an evil person
from the very start.

175
00:09:26,396 --> 00:09:27,454
If I give in to my rage right now,

176
00:09:27,455 --> 00:09:30,798
I could just grab Arianne's hand
and let her taste true agony.

177
00:09:31,397 --> 00:09:34,248
But what I truly want
is a flawless revenge

178
00:09:34,249 --> 00:09:37,656
that exposes all her and High Priest's
crimes to the world.

179
00:09:38,052 --> 00:09:40,149
I can't let my emotions
get the better of me.

180
00:09:43,257 --> 00:09:45,656
It's my turn to go on.
I need to get over there.

181
00:09:46,252 --> 00:09:47,453
Arianne.

182
00:09:47,454 --> 00:09:51,019
One day, you'll pay for your crimes.

183
00:09:51,802 --> 00:09:53,616
I will make sure you get your comeuppance.

184
00:09:55,356 --> 00:09:57,856
I wish you can pull that off.

185
00:09:57,857 --> 00:10:00,653
That is, if you manage to live that long.

186
00:10:04,752 --> 00:10:07,348
Those petty tricks just won't do.

187
00:10:07,349 --> 00:10:09,958
Any woman
who steals Prince Sven away from me

188
00:10:09,959 --> 00:10:11,708
must disappear from this world.

189
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:14,701
The night before the Birth Festival began,

190
00:10:14,702 --> 00:10:18,353
I secretly tampered
with that temporary stage.

191
00:10:18,354 --> 00:10:20,800
If I pull this rope,
the whole stage will collapse,

192
00:10:20,801 --> 00:10:23,253
and the performer
will be crushed underneath it.

193
00:10:23,254 --> 00:10:26,351
I'll do it when Lua takes the stage
and make it look like an accident.

194
00:10:29,652 --> 00:10:33,203
Come on, start playing, Lua Restoatt.

195
00:10:33,752 --> 00:10:36,860
I'll turn this piece
into your very own requiem.

196
00:10:39,856 --> 00:10:42,248
What an elegant performance.

197
00:10:42,249 --> 00:10:46,705
That Candidate Saintess is the Rose Princess
for the second year in a row.

198
00:10:46,706 --> 00:10:49,741
She's probably the most promising candidate
to become the Saintess.

199
00:10:50,201 --> 00:10:54,159
Being in the spotlight
really does feel amazing.

200
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:57,504
All this praise is for me alone.

201
00:10:57,505 --> 00:11:01,500
Before long,
the position of Saintess will be mine.

202
00:11:05,459 --> 00:11:07,094
I'm the next to go on.

203
00:11:07,859 --> 00:11:12,099
I wonder if Sven is listening
to my performance from somewhere.

204
00:11:12,696 --> 00:11:13,800
What am I thinking?

205
00:11:14,198 --> 00:11:17,402
He's been so busy lately,
I doubt he can spare the time.

206
00:11:23,653 --> 00:11:25,806
Lua has started playing.

207
00:11:25,807 --> 00:11:26,755
Now's the time.

208
00:11:27,149 --> 00:11:30,015
Die, Lua!

